r-4be48e3e-1c40-52d4-a265-9d0205cf8f91" :answer/id #uuid "4be48e3e-1c40-52d4-a265-9d0205cf8f91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "23" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1814fbcd-9f92-515e-9828-c49eef2bbaf2" :answer/id #uuid "1814fbcd-9f92-515e-9828-c49eef2bbaf2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "26" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5731e481-0681-52ab-b6b9-e017c2f03b1a" :answer/id #uuid "5731e481-0681-52ab-b6b9-e017c2f03b1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-69f8f087-b4ab-539a-a92a-71c2b7e860e7" :answer/id #uuid "69f8f087-b4ab-539a-a92a-71c2b7e860e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "43" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9e4a93a5-5f1b-534c-a5dc-2740ee32a078" :answer/id #uuid "9e4a93a5-5f1b-534c-a5dc-2740ee32a078" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "53" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186087710 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-7f25e8cf-a84e-5491-8095-e34846bd72c0"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-7f25e8cf-a84e-5491-8095-e34846bd72c0" :question/id #uuid "7f25e8cf-a84e-5491-8095-e34846bd72c0" :question/math-academy-id "q-109613" :question/problem "Write $y=\\frac{1}{5}x+2$ in standard form." :question/worked-solution "Our goal is to write the equation in the form $ax+by=c,$ where $a,b,$ and $c$ are integers with no common factors and $a\\ge 0.$\n\nWe begin by moving all of the variables to the left-hand side and all of the constants to the right-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n-\\frac{1}{5}x+y=2\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply both sides of the equation by $-1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{5}x+y & =2 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{5}x+y) & =(-1)\\cdot (2) \\\\ \\frac{1}{5}x-y & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we multiply both sides of the equation by $5:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{5}x-y & =-2 \\\\ 5\\cdot (\\frac{1}{5}x-y) & =5\\cdot (-2) \\\\ x-5y & =-10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, $a,b,$ and $c$ are integers with no common factors, and $a\\ge 0.$ So we are done!\n\nThe standard form of the line is $x-5y=-10.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dad8335d-f4a7-566b-a578-6ac7a63c8d7b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dad8335d-f4a7-566b-a578-6ac7a63c8d7b" :answer-field/id #uuid "dad8335d-f4a7-566b-a578-6ac7a63c8d7b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-448eccfb-3c08-5bec-841b-585bee529c4e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9061fc30-c374-57e8-aa75-804d2bbafc4a" "answer-fa2a9e76-21e6-55c2-8f02-1bd6cfa3e2c8" "answer-bd9e69fa-90c3-5ff9-b4f9-43eaf28f779f" "answer-448eccfb-3c08-5bec-841b-585bee529c4e" "answer-60d77254-fa6e-530c-8178-4237af50304a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9061fc30-c374-57e8-aa75-804d2bbafc4a" :answer/id #uuid "9061fc30-c374-57e8-aa75-804d2bbafc4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}x-y=-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fa2a9e76-21e6-55c2-8f02-1bd6cfa3e2c8" :answer/id #uuid "fa2a9e76-21e6-55c2-8f02-1bd6cfa3e2c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+5y=5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bd9e69fa-90c3-5ff9-b4f9-43eaf28f779f" :answer/id #uuid "bd9e69fa-90c3-5ff9-b4f9-43eaf28f779f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-5y+10=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-448eccfb-3c08-5bec-841b-585bee529c4e" :answer/id #uuid "448eccfb-3c08-5bec-841b-585bee529c4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-5y=-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-60d77254-fa6e-530c-8178-4237af50304a" :answer/id #uuid "60d77254-fa6e-530c-8178-4237af50304a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=5y-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186083191 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-745d6485-4fab-5db3-ad5a-442675f1d8d6"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-745d6485-4fab-5db3-ad5a-442675f1d8d6" :question/id #uuid "745d6485-4fab-5db3-ad5a-442675f1d8d6" :question/math-academy-id "q-3682" :question/problem "![](images/a3/a32739957ef5ff1bf81f49b1b1baaaab69c6ef3d2613f8ac09ad4020c91c50f7.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the curve shown above?" :question/worked-solution "Remember that $y=|x-h|+k$ is a vertical translation of the absolute value graph $y=|x|$ by $h$ units right and $k$ units up.\n\nHere, the graph is moved left by $4$ units and down by $1$ unit. This corresponds to $h=-4$ and $k=-1.$ So, the equation of the graph is $y=|x+4|-1.$\n\n![](images/fc/fcaf6e4e5e5fa63724be00a344c725e8bc9095c74c8b1114a0dbe90e9ac31935.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ea40d3ec-5a65-5f11-9245-74d21f7dd219"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ea40d3ec-5a65-5f11-9245-74d21f7dd219" :answer-field/id #uuid "ea40d3ec-5a65-5f11-9245-74d21f7dd219" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3cfff7a7-330b-572e-90cb-b9b5dddb8228" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d81edf6b-b7ac-5848-8692-2e21c1530fbc" "answer-42b5a490-0ee5-549d-8703-5b5cf81273db" "answer-3cfff7a7-330b-572e-90cb-b9b5dddb8228" "answer-13486019-a392-57be-a337-f52f79477f44" "answer-a91352d6-0efc-5355-a4fa-9b60746ec3f8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d81edf6b-b7ac-5848-8692-2e21c1530fbc" :answer/id #uuid "d81edf6b-b7ac-5848-8692-2e21c1530fbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=|x+1|-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-42b5a490-0ee5-549d-8703-5b5cf81273db" :answer/id #uuid "42b5a490-0ee5-549d-8703-5b5cf81273db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=|x+4|+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3cfff7a7-330b-572e-90cb-b9b5dddb8228" :answer/id #uuid "3cfff7a7-330b-572e-90cb-b9b5dddb8228" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=|x+4|-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-13486019-a392-57be-a337-f52f79477f44" :answer/id #uuid "13486019-a392-57be-a337-f52f79477f44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=|x-1|-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a91352d6-0efc-5355-a4fa-9b60746ec3f8" :answer/id #uuid "a91352d6-0efc-5355-a4fa-9b60746ec3f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=|x-4|-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186152110 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-1ac9a15a-91b5-5333-bd21-1c4aeb66e1dd"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-1ac9a15a-91b5-5333-bd21-1c4aeb66e1dd" :question/id #uuid "1ac9a15a-91b5-5333-bd21-1c4aeb66e1dd" :question/math-academy-id "q-67953" :question/problem "![](images/7f/7f021a38a2c0c2098c14b2af479a609e85f6903ec84b4eafc71cb599becee3d9.png)\n\nWhich of the graphs above represent proportional relationships?" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the graph of a proportional relationship is always a straight line that passes through the origin $(0,0).$\n\nOf the given graphs, only graph III fits this description.\n\n- Graph I is not a straight line.\n\n- Graphs II and IV do not pass through the origin $(0,0).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-75afd0e8-6c0a-5237-becc-83e629f28d7f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-75afd0e8-6c0a-5237-becc-83e629f28d7f" :answer-field/id #uuid "75afd0e8-6c0a-5237-becc-83e629f28d7f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1fab5eef-9775-58f4-b57d-cb792b17ff32" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d7cfb344-0165-53cc-9422-4c18679479dc" "answer-5ff222c4-39ce-5121-9b09-72ad59c1f29e" "answer-3630b97b-56be-52b8-9178-cb1d3166fdf2" "answer-1fab5eef-9775-58f4-b57d-cb792b17ff32" "answer-10690335-5930-5fef-a862-6eb8da552d97"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d7cfb344-0165-53cc-9422-4c18679479dc" :answer/id #uuid "d7cfb344-0165-5