{t}^{2}-5,\\,2t+2,\\,5t⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Evaluating the function at $t=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(1) & =⟨8({1}^{2})-5,\\,2(1)+2,\\,5(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,4,\\,5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(1)| & =\\sqrt{{(3)}^{2}+{(4)}^{2}+(5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+16+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{50} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-03372984-3b6a-52fd-b939-f99920dffdff"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-03372984-3b6a-52fd-b939-f99920dffdff" :answer-field/id #uuid "03372984-3b6a-52fd-b939-f99920dffdff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-31837ee6-10ca-577f-944f-bdb787e80bd6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9200df3f-c132-5c9d-b7e0-d5ed27923967" "answer-b7701537-72c1-5510-bb99-fa0372ec42ec" "answer-637850e7-5b69-5e11-8f07-9bcea38d6888" "answer-31837ee6-10ca-577f-944f-bdb787e80bd6" "answer-988fc287-3433-562c-bd45-9cb784417c65"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9200df3f-c132-5c9d-b7e0-d5ed27923967" :answer/id #uuid "9200df3f-c132-5c9d-b7e0-d5ed27923967" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b7701537-72c1-5510-bb99-fa0372ec42ec" :answer/id #uuid "b7701537-72c1-5510-bb99-fa0372ec42ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-637850e7-5b69-5e11-8f07-9bcea38d6888" :answer/id #uuid "637850e7-5b69-5e11-8f07-9bcea38d6888" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-31837ee6-10ca-577f-944f-bdb787e80bd6" :answer/id #uuid "31837ee6-10ca-577f-944f-bdb787e80bd6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-988fc287-3433-562c-bd45-9cb784417c65" :answer/id #uuid "988fc287-3433-562c-bd45-9cb784417c65" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{15}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064558 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064178 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-bd10b8fd-b17b-505d-be34-31b755b59a68"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-bd10b8fd-b17b-505d-be34-31b755b59a68" :question/id #uuid "bd10b8fd-b17b-505d-be34-31b755b59a68" :question/math-academy-id "q-71655" :question/problem "$\\int (8\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (8\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =8\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C \\\\  & =-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1700a89d-2650-5aef-adea-d21bee253a61"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1700a89d-2650-5aef-adea-d21bee253a61" :answer-field/id #uuid "1700a89d-2650-5aef-adea-d21bee253a61" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-cfa7ffc1-052c-532e-8da6-94ac7004b9a9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a9719d4f-c0e6-58b1-9042-0f8dc0cc5b3a" "answer-cfa7ffc1-052c-532e-8da6-94ac7004b9a9" "answer-e5572e89-e95f-550c-955c-320f0b7a840a" "answer-322df916-39b9-599e-a476-810f5cef3397" "answer-7c2fc9f8-9ba6-5343-a7ed-17d93cc87a5f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a9719d4f-c0e6-58b1-9042-0f8dc0cc5b3a" :answer/id #uuid "a9719d4f-c0e6-58b1-9042-0f8dc0cc5b3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :a