on "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int {sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-5{sec}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 5{sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-5\\int {sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-5\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-08e04e2e-7eca-562c-852b-2c70ebf8ebaf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-08e04e2e-7eca-562c-852b-2c70ebf8ebaf" :answer-field/id #uuid "08e04e2e-7eca-562c-852b-2c70ebf8ebaf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1f40bf7b-d980-5c37-9185-3b085c9c5c53" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9dd5d538-c487-511e-8d7f-5e1b4ffcc218" "answer-00c21b53-f065-504c-a5e3-aa2005a3edca" "answer-ad986292-1692-5d51-b82b-3cd472c78eb1" "answer-1f40bf7b-d980-5c37-9185-3b085c9c5c53" "answer-3a387fb4-5f8e-534c-9e75-92e6cdf63fa6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9dd5d538-c487-511e-8d7f-5e1b4ffcc218" :answer/id #uuid "9dd5d538-c487-511e-8d7f-5e1b4ffcc218" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+5\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C." :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-00c21b53-f065-504c-a5e3-aa2005a3edca" :answer/id #uuid "00c21b53-f065-504c-a5e3-aa2005a3edca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+5\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C." :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ad986292-1692-5d51-b82b-3cd472c78eb1" :answer/id #uuid "ad986292-1692-5d51-b82b-3cd472c78eb1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+5\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C." :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1f40bf7b-d980-5c37-9185-3b085c9c5c53" :answer/id #uuid "1f40bf7b-d980-5c37-9185-3b085c9c5c53" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-5\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C." :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3a387fb4-5f8e-534c-9e75-92e6cdf63fa6" :answer/id #uuid "3a387fb4-5f8e-534c-9e75-92e6cdf63fa6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x+C." :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064181 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-aefe8a56-b826-5c47-afc1-22f96d795fb8"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-aefe8a56-b826-5c47-afc1-22f96d795fb8" :question/id #uuid "aefe8a56-b826-5c47-afc1-22f96d795fb8" :question/math-academy-id "q-49123" :question/problem "$\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x(6\\operatorname{csc}⁡x-5\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x(6\\operatorname{csc}⁡x-5\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x & =\\int (6{csc}^{2}⁡x-5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 6{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-5\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)-5(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x)+C \\\\  & =-6\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6d0a6d73-32b4-5324-aae6-b3e318afe759"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6d0a6d73-32b4-5324-aae6-b3e318afe759" :answer-field/id #uuid "6d0a6d73-32b4-5324-aae6-b3e318afe759" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-18bcbe64-bb6f-55cf-a9d1-22e95a1231bd" :answer-field/choices ["answer-18bcbe64-bb6f-55cf-a9d1-22e95a1231bd" "answer-f8c18cbb-8412-58a3-a55e-23de81200289" "answer-9b5373b4-ce2d-560c-85b8-db62e75a98a9" "answer-2fc267db-4bcb-55dc-bdea-9ddc9b01a7b7" "answer-c9e90b57-bb92-5b49-98e6-3e0a2d915c73"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-18bcbe64-bb6f-55cf-a9d1-22e95a1231bd" :answer/id #uuid "18bcbe64-bb6f-55cf-a9d1-22e95a1231bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f8c18cbb-8412-58a3-a55e-23de81200289" :answer/id #uuid "f8c18cbb-8412-58a3-a55e-23de81200289" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-5\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9b5373b4-ce2d-560c-85b8-db62e75a98a9" :answer/id #uuid "9b5373b4-ce2d-560c-85b8-db62e75a98a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-5\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2fc267db-4bcb-55dc-bdea-9ddc9b01a7b7" :answer/id #uuid "2fc267db-4bcb-55dc-bdea-9ddc9b01a7b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c9e90b57-bb92-5b49-98e6-3e0a2d915c73" :answer/id #uuid "c9e90b57-bb92-5b49-98e6-3e0a2d915c73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186065409 :tutorial/content "We know that the derivative of sine is cosine:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\sin{x}) = \\cos{x}\n$$\n\nSince integration is the reverse of differentiation, we see that the integral of cosine is sine:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{x}\\,\\textrm d x = \\sin{x} + C\n$$\n\nWe can discover two other integrals by considering the derivatives of cosine and tangent:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C \\\\ \\int {sec}^{2}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimilarly, by considering the derivatives of secant, cosecant, and cotangent, we arrive at\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C \\\\ \\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWith these six formulas, we can integrate many different trigonometric functions." :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064392 :activity/expected-seconds 420.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id 17592186233095 :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-67ad5e66-9a6f-510f-88e0-2dbf3a4879dc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-67ad5e66-9a6f-510f-88e0-2dbf3a4879dc" :answer-field/id #uuid "67ad5e66-9a6f-510f-88e0-2dbf3a4879dc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a6d922cf-b1ce-5f45-b313-31d7781464c3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3cbfaf6e-59f5-5d74-890e-469bac68f415" "answer-c75af15b-b930-5b18-8047-458120c58d58" "answer-a6d922cf-b1ce-5f45-b313-31d7781464c3" "answer-380faa34-ff12-5c2b-985e-2ed10aec2dd0" "answer-da040721-f117-50c1-b07d-e4e1b3b8cb75"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3cbfaf6e-59f5-5d74-890e-469bac68f415" :answer/id #uuid "3cbfaf6e-59f5-5d74-890e-469bac68f415" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "75{x}^{13}-32{x}^{7}+35{x}^{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c75af15b-b930-5b18-8047-458120c58d58" :answer/id #uuid "c75af15b-b930-5b18-8047-458120c58d58" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "75{x}^{14}-28{x}^{7}+35{x}^{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a6d922cf-b1ce-5f45-b313-31d7781464c3" :answer/id #uuid "a6d922cf-b1ce-5f45-b313-31d7781464c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "75{x}^{14}-32{x}^{7}+35{x}^{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-380faa34-ff12-5c2b-985e-2ed10aec2dd0" :answer/id #uuid "380faa34-ff12-5c2b-985e-2ed10aec2dd0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "75{x}^{14}-32{x}^{7}+35{x}^{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-da040721-f117-50c1-b07d-e4e1b3b8cb75" :answer/id #uuid "da040721-f117-50c1-b07d-e4e1b3b8cb75" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "75{x}^{14}-32{x}^{7}-35{x}^{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186059865 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-cf599dd3-905a-52d6-aba1-39b367c49961"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-cf599dd3-905a-52d6-aba1-39b367c49961" :question/id #uuid "cf599dd3-905a-52d6-aba1-39b367c49961" :question/math-academy-id "q-10729" :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=3{x}^{4}+\\frac{4}{{x}^{3}}+12.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we apply the addition, constant multiple, and power rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{4}+\\frac{4}{{x}^{3}}+12) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{4})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{x}^{-3})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(12) \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{4})+4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{-3})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(12) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 4{x}^{(4-1)}+4\\cdot (-3){x}^{(-3-1)}+0 \\\\  & =12{x}^{3}-12{x}^{-4} \\\\  & =12{x}^{3}-\\frac{12}{{x}^{4}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1947ca64-c378-5eaf-88bb-6fa8b0b04f62"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1947ca64-c378-5eaf-88bb-6fa8b0b04f62" :answer-field/id #uuid "1947ca64-c378-5eaf-88bb-6fa8b0b04f62" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b4161ec8-df10-5639-aeed-ff5b15276588" :answer-field/choices ["answer-520860b5-7e56-5449-9080-6f8047f872aa" "answer-b4161ec8-df10-5639-aeed-ff5b15276588" "answer-be041e10-bb70-5b3b-afab-6f4cde2c6e92" "answer-b68d1b42-de6c-5986-9971-7281fe560230" "answer-ea78f316-486b-58b6-867b-8ea0fecd9188"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-520860b5-7e56-5449-9080-6f8047f872aa" :answer/id #uuid "520860b5-7e56-5449-9080-6f8047f872aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12{x}^{3}+\\frac{12}{{x}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b4161ec8-df10-5639-aeed-ff5b15276588" :answer/id #uuid "b4161ec8-df10-5639-aeed-ff5b15276588" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12{x}^{3}-\\frac{12}{{x}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-be041e10-bb70-5b3b-afab-6f4cde2c6e92" :answer/id #uuid "be041e10-bb70-5b3b-afab-6f4cde2c6e92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12{x}^{3}-\\frac{12}{{x}^{4}}+12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b68d1b42-de6c-5986-9971-7281fe560230" :answer/id #uuid "b68d1b42-de6c-5986-9971-7281fe560230" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12{x}^{4}-\\frac{12}{{x}^{3}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ea78f316-486b-58b6-867b-8ea0fecd9188" :answer/id #uuid "ea78f316-486b-58b6-867b-8ea0fecd9188" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{3}-\\frac{4}{{x}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186059975 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "activity-04559068-825a-5526-b209-815e131f3f42" :activity/id #uuid "04559068-825a-5526-b209-815e131f3f42" :activity/title "The Sum and Constant Multiple Rules for Differentiation" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048932 :activity/course 17592186046647 :activity/steps ["step-5333d22e-d19f-5ca3-9791-2b97ddb2177c" "step-5b8cdc22-2e56-51ba-83ba-7a593d15afcf" "step-e6696668-438e-5952-87af-a577069217ea" "step-61acd48b-c578-5bb4-990a-388bf180a7e0"] :activity/first-step "step-53